<template><section aria-label="单条器官支持原资料核对"><p v-if="checking">正在核对原资料归属、完整摘要与公开原量。</p><p v-else-if="!verified" role="alert">单条原资料与患者、住院、原件、公开投影或完整摘要不一致，不展示其他范围数值。</p><template v-else><p>仅所选一条原资料及其明确关联，不代表完整交班、24小时最差状态、完整SOFA或脓毒症诊断，不提供概率或自动治疗。</p><p>{{ supportKinds[verified.kind].label }} · 原来源 {{ verified.support_source_id }}。原事件UTC {{ verified.event_at ?? '未知，不代填当前核实时刻' }}；系统登记/当前核实签署UTC {{ verified.recorded_at }}。</p><p>原资料由人工记录或当前核实，尚无独立临床验证；当前回顾不能追认为旧截止时已知。原量未换算；未知和0分别保留。</p><p v-if="verified.clinical_review_signed">保留实际医生的当前核实签署，不能代替原时刻可用性。</p><template v-if="['respiratory_support','vasoactive'].includes(verified.kind)"><p>原开始 {{ verified.facts.start_at }}；已核实止点 {{ verified.facts.verified_until_at }}；明确停止 {{ verified.facts.ended_at ?? '未明确停止，只核实到原止点' }}。连续性{{ verified.facts.continuity_confirmed?'已确认':'未确认' }}。</p></template><p v-if="verified.kind==='arterial_pair'">动脉样本{{ flag(verified.facts.arterial_sample_confirmed) }}；同采样状态{{ flag(verified.facts.same_sampling_state_confirmed) }}；FiO₂适用{{ flag(verified.facts.fio2_applicability_confirmed) }}。三个确认独立保留，不自动最近配对或计算P/F比。</p><p v-if="verified.kind==='vasoactive'">明确原药物 {{ verified.reference_facts.drug_mapping.drug_key }}；活性口径 {{ verified.reference_facts.drug_mapping.active_moiety_basis }}；原输入 {{ verified.facts.dose_input.mode }}。直接ug/kg/min不再次除体重；不自动默认70kg、浓度或等效剂量。</p><p v-if="verified.kind==='infection_episode'">感染核实 {{ verified.facts.infection_status }}；临床范围 {{ verified.facts.clinical_scope_start_at }} 至 {{ verified.facts.clinical_scope_end_at ?? '未知终点' }}；首次怀疑 {{ verified.facts.first_suspected_at ?? '未知' }}；原发生 {{ verified.facts.onset_at ?? '未知' }}。感染不等于脓毒症或急性器官功能变化归因。</p><el-table :data="rows" aria-label="单条原资料公开原量"><el-table-column prop="label" label="原字段" min-width="180" /><el-table-column prop="value" label="原值/未测原因" min-width="180" /><el-table-column prop="unit" label="原单位" /><el-table-column prop="clock" label="实际原UTC" min-width="230" /></el-table><p v-if="verified.reference_facts?.origin">原已给药来源链保留原始无时区钟点，仅作本地溯源，不作为连续UTC证明。</p><p>模型只接收本次公开原量与已审核知识。完整原件、人工自由文字依据、患者/住院标识及补充问题留在本地核对。</p><el-button link @click="$emit('inspect',verified.source_id)">核对本条冻结完整原件</el-button></template></section></template>
<script setup>
import { computed, onActivated, onBeforeUnmount, onDeactivated, ref, watch } from "vue";
import { verifySupportContext } from "@/api/aiSupportContext";
import { supportCanonical, supportKinds } from "@/api/inpatientSupport";
const props=defineProps({findings:{type:Object,default:null},expectedPatientId:{type:Number,required:true},expectedAdmissionId:{type:String,required:true},references:{type:Object,default:null},active:{type:Boolean,default:true}});defineEmits(["inspect"]);
const verified=ref(null),checking=ref(false);let epoch=0,inactive=false;
const signature=()=>supportCanonical([props.findings,props.expectedPatientId,props.expectedAdmissionId,props.references,props.active]);
async function check(){const seq=++epoch,key=signature();verified.value=null;checking.value=false;if(!props.active||inactive||!props.findings)return;checking.value=true;const packet=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(props.findings));try{if(await verifySupportContext(packet,props.expectedPatientId,props.expectedAdmissionId,props.references)&&seq===epoch&&key===signature()&&!inactive&&props.active)verified.value=packet.support_source;}finally{if(seq===epoch)checking.value=false;}}
const flag=value=>value?'已确认':'未确认',quantity=(label,q,clock)=>({label,value:q?.value??`未测（${q?.absent_reason??'未知'}）`,unit:q?.unit??'原单位未知',clock});
const rows=computed(()=>{const s=verified.value;if(!s)return [];const f=s.facts,r=s.reference_facts;if(s.kind==='map')return [quantity('MAP',f.map,f.observed_at),{label:'原测量方式',value:f.measurement_method,unit:'',clock:f.observed_at}];if(s.kind==='respiratory_support')return [{label:'原呼吸支持方式',value:f.delivery_mode,unit:'',clock:f.start_at}];if(s.kind==='arterial_pair')return [quantity('PaO₂',{value:r.pao2.original.value_num,unit:r.pao2.original.unit},r.pao2.collected_at_utc),quantity('FiO₂',r.fio2.measurement,r.fio2.observed_at),{label:'原呼吸支持方式',value:r.support.facts.delivery_mode,unit:'',clock:r.support.facts.start_at}];if(s.kind==='vasoactive'){const d=f.dose_input,result=d.mode==='pump'?[quantity('原配液浓度',d.concentration,f.start_at),quantity('原泵速',d.pump_rate,f.start_at)]:[quantity('原给入速率',d.rate,f.start_at)];if(r.weight)result.push(quantity('明确原体重',r.weight.measurement,r.weight.observed_at));return result;}return (r.evidence||[]).map(item=>item.original?quantity(item.analyte_key,{value:item.original.value_num,unit:item.original.unit},item.collected_at_utc):{label:'原诊断审核确定性',value:item.certainty,unit:'',clock:'原无时区时刻，仅作本地溯源'});});
watch(signature,check,{immediate:true,flush:'sync'});onDeactivated(()=>{inactive=true;epoch++;verified.value=null;checking.value=false;});onActivated(()=>{if(inactive){inactive=false;check();}});onBeforeUnmount(()=>{inactive=true;epoch++;verified.value=null;});
</script>
<style scoped>p{line-height:1.7;overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style>
